/docs/
**/*.md
!AGENTS.md
**/*.pdf
**/*.doc
**/*.docx
**/*.ppt
**/*.pptx
LICENSE
VERSION

# Screenshots and raster images; runtime SVG icons remain included
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.webp
**/*.heic
**/*.bmp
**/*.tif
**/*.tiff

# Build outputs and temporary files
dist/
build/
**/*.aix
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
